 Deep Learning PracticeA streamlined repository dedicated to practicing and mastering Artificial Neural Network (ANN) concepts using TensorFlow and Keras.
🎯 Repository Goal: 
The primary objective of this repository is to build intuition for foundational neural networks through hands-on coding and experimentation.
🧠 Concepts CoveredANN Foundations:
 Perceptrons, forward propagation, and backpropagation.Activation Functions: ReLU, Sigmoid, Softmax, and Tanh.Optimization & Loss: Gradient Descent, Adam, Cross-Entropy, and MSE.Model Tuning: Regularization, Dropout, and Batch Normalization.
🛠️ Tech : 
 StackPython 3TensorFlow 2.xKerasJupyter Notebooks